  "key_finding": "NO — Night/day RV decomposition does NOT significantly improve HAR forecasting of total RV (DM t=1.08, not significant). HAR-DN-Ratio marginally better on r^2 (DM t=-6.27) but not on native RV target. Night ratio IS coefficient not significant (t=-0.66). Standard HAR-RV remains best. HAR-DN with 6 regressors overfits OOS (QLIKE=33.6 due to prediction level instability despite Spearman=0.762).",
